  "text": "Meet Miluva, the most delightful dictation app for Omaki. A tiny presence on your desktop. Speak and your words stay right with you. Open the workspace. Keep the thought going. Live rewrite turns a rough idea into a clear draft as you speak. Both sides stay steady. Your original stays yours. Copy it, polish it, rewrite it. Make the final edit and save. Your notes are ready when you return. Control P puts the next action under your fingers. And when Omaki changes its theme, Miluva follows. Quiet design, clear words, a little more delight every day.",
